# Doodle, Derp's search engine: where its results come from, picked when you
# first start Derp (right after making your dork).

derp-doodle-ask = Where should Doodle get its results?
derp-doodle-ask-about = Doodle is Derp’s search engine. It looks the same either way, in Doodle’s own look.
derp-doodle-google = Google
derp-doodle-google-about = The biggest index of the web. Doodle hides Google’s AI and its Sign in.
derp-doodle-duckduckgo = DuckDuckGo
derp-doodle-duckduckgo-about = Private search that doesn’t track you or keep a profile of your searches.
derp-doodle-later = You can change this any time in Settings → Derp → Doodle.
